{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0019_rule_first_resolution_decision", "label": "ADR-0019: Rule-first resolution", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0019-rule-first-resolution.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Many jobs-domain derived beliefs are arithmetic over structured fields (CGPA vs cutoff, batch match, deadlines); LLM per memory costs calls, risks arithmetic errors and flatters check-everything baseline (C4). Resolver chain: pure RuleResolvers first, else LLM resolver; rules in domain adapters, core provides chain and protocols; rule decisions cite structured fields as evidence (I2). Evidence in docs/proposals/0001.", "tradeoffs": "Rejected LLM-only, calculator tool for the LLM, rules inside the Linker. Cost: a wrong rule is confidently wrong; rules only for kinds with labelled bench cases; ablation 'without rules' measures effect.", "status": "Accepted (autonomous mandate; from proposal 0001)", "date": "2026-10-19", "revisit_if": "Rules disagree with LLM on more than a few percent of labelled cases, or jobs rules grow into a second business-logic layer", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_adr_0019_rule_first_resolution_ruleresolver", "label": "RuleResolver", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0019-rule-first-resolution.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pure function resolver; first returning a Resolution wins.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_adr_0019_rule_first_resolution_resolverchain", "label": "ResolverChain (ripple.core.resolver)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0019-rule-first-resolution.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Is itself a Resolver; tries rules then falls back to LLM resolver.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_adr_0019_rule_fir